	(text "TRIPLE DRIFT | Phase 1 | Rev A\n9V battery -> protected supply -> 3 x NE555 oscillators\nPitch + mute per voice -> AC coupling -> level pots\nResistive mixer -> master volume -> LM386 -> 8 ohm speaker\nPLAY / DRONE enables oscillators. Panel controls wired to headers.\nHand-soldered through-hole PCB. Prototype: physical testing pending."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
